        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>If you’ve been thinking about LASIK, you probably have a few questions. Our <a href=\"/hours-location/\">eye clinic in Pine Beach</a> helps you understand your options, determine if you’re a good candidate, and guide you through every step of the process. From your first consultation to follow-up care, you won’t have to figure anything out on your own.</p>",
