        {
          "t": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "What is LASIK Eye Surgery?",
          "html": "What is LASIK Eye Surgery?",
          "align": "center",
          "id": "iLibYbcwOq",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>LASIK is a type of laser eye surgery designed to correct vision problems like nearsightedness, farsightedness, and astigmatism. The goal is to reduce, or even eliminate, your need for glasses or contact lenses. It’s a widely performed procedure, but knowing if it’s right for you starts with a proper evaluation.</p>",
          "align": "center",
          "id": "uU9O3SyS38",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "button",
