        {
          "t": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Ideal LASIK Candidates",
          "html": "Ideal LASIK Candidates",
          "id": "MQT9FUKZNg",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>LASIK isn’t for everyone, but many people are great candidates. You may be a good fit if:</p><ul><li>Your prescription has stayed stable over time</li><li>Your eyes are generally healthy</li><li>You’re looking to reduce your dependence on glasses or contacts</li><li>Your vision falls within a treatable range</li></ul>",
          "id": "hswrRoTP8o",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
