          "text": "Co-Management at Academy Vision",
          "html": "Co-Management at Academy Vision",
          "id": "ARtfcczQNo",
          "col": 1,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>We’re here to make the entire process feel clear and manageable. We start by evaluating your eyes and helping you decide if LASIK is the right choice for you. If it is, we’ll connect you with a local eye surgeon and coordinate your care.</p><p>Before and after your procedure, you’ll come back to us for your <a href=\"/eye-care-services/comprehensive-eye-exams/\">eye exams</a> and follow-ups, so you have a familiar place for answers and support.</p>",
          "id": "Jvw2o2JbAG",
          "col": 1,
          "origin": "static"
