          "t": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "What the LASIK Process Looks Like",
          "html": "What the LASIK Process Looks Like",
          "id": "D0gbasbmZh",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>We keep the process straightforward and make sure you always know what to expect:</p><ul><li>We start with a <a href=\"/eye-care-services/pediatric-eye-care/\">comprehensive eye evaluation</a> to determine if LASIK is right for you</li><li>We coordinate your referral to a local surgeon for the procedure</li><li>We prepare you for surgery so you feel confident going in</li><li>We handle your follow-up care and monitor your healing</li></ul>",
          "id": "6btRN5JJvG",
